WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:22.443
Open Quick update and find Order deadline.

2
00:00:22.443 --> 00:00:27.249
Press Order deadline.

3
00:00:27.249 --> 00:00:30.337
Type what it is for.

4
00:00:30.337 --> 00:00:33.265
Pick the last day you can take an order.

5
00:00:33.265 --> 00:00:36.594
Leave the last box empty
and it is worded for you.

6
00:00:36.594 --> 00:00:39.518
Press Put it on my website.

7
00:00:39.518 --> 00:00:43.636
It comes down by itself after that day.
